<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>BioNTech=E2=80=99s BNT113 resu=
lt narrows the mRNA cancer-vaccine thesis.</strong> Adding a fixed HPV16 E6/E=
7 mRNA immunotherapy to pembrolizumab did not significantly improve progressi=
on-free survival in first-line PD-L1-positive head-and-neck cancer. Overall s=
urvival remains a co-primary endpoint and can still make the trial formally p=
ositive, but the absence of any disclosed PFS effect size lowers confidence. =
